--- !u!114 &4711141076361361370
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6957133937521724285}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e240c06d55e336e4992e5ea3b7b63abf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  Dialogue:
    DialogueLines:
    - 'You: What''s with the fancy place? And the flowers?'
    - '???: You don''t like the Yellow Acacias?'
    - 'You: Nah, it''s just.... Never Mind, You wanted to ask me something?'
    - '???: Yeah, Uh... Did you get invited to that party this friday?'
    - 'You: I did, Why? Are you going?'
    - '???: I might, If you''re there...

'
    - 'You: Huh... I thought for a moment that you had work that day.

'
    - '???: Huh? Oh... yeah... I do, Right, I don''t think I can show up at the party
      then...

'
    - 'You: How come you''re always working?

'
    - '???: Well... I just need a lot of cash for... something, It''s a bit personal...

'
    - 'You: Even then, You''re working ungodly hours. It can''t be good for your
      health, or for your mind...

'
    - '???: You''re right, but the world is dark, doesn''t let you off easy for anything.
      It''s all just designed for work

'
    - 'You: Jesus I mean, I know the world is tough and all but-

'
    - '???: If you don''t have something to cling on then, it''ll just... squeeze
      you until everything''s left gray.

'
    - 'You: and what''s that something you''re clinging onto?

'
    - '???: ...

'
    - '???: Our food is here...'
    - End Conversation
